<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pȳgargus</span></b> , i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύγαργος</span> (whiterump).
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of eagle</i>, perh. the <i>bald
				eagle</i> or <i>fish-hawk</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 3,
				3, § 7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A kind of antelope</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 53,
				79, § 214</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 11,
				138</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Deut. 14, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
